      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "When I enable Mirror in a world compatible with Windows, Android, and iOS, I receive a notification that ATOK36DE.DLL has been blocked, and VRChat becomes unresponsive.\n\nHowever, I encountered no issues when displaying Mirror in a world compatible only with Windows.\n\nI hope this information helps resolve the issue.",
