      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue also occurs with Mozkey, another third-party Japanese IME. Microsoft IME and Google Japanese Input work, but Mozkey cannot input Japanese in VRChat. This may affect third-party IMEs more broadly, not only ATOK.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
